WEBVTT

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:03.480
What?

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:07.480
Rio is my cousin and a 
prince of this kingdom?

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.710
Yes, that's how things turned out.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:13.340
It isn't officially acknowledged, 
but Rio is of the royal family.

00:00:14.810 --> 00:00:17.990
Could it be that the two 
of you are teasing me?

00:00:19.390 --> 00:00:24.130
There's no way an average village 
person could marry a princess!

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:27.590
Rio's father gained 
recognition during the war,

00:00:27.590 --> 00:00:29.750
and was raised to the rank of warrior-noble.

00:00:29.750 --> 00:00:33.720
All of us elderly folk 
in the village know the story.

00:00:33.970 --> 00:00:39.020
A warrior-noble... In that case, it wouldn't
 be so strange to meet a princess.

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:40.220
Would it?

00:00:40.220 --> 00:00:42.640
That's what I've been saying, isn't it?

00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:47.190
Huh? Uh... L-L-Lord Rio!

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.550
I-I apologize for my rudeness!

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:54.010
Please, wait. Let's not do that, all right?

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:55.530
B-But...

00:00:55.530 --> 00:00:59.340
L-Lord Rio, you're royalty, aren't you?

00:00:59.340 --> 00:01:04.000
My mother may have been, 
but I'm not. So, please...

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:06.760
Treat me the way you have been up to now.

00:01:08.730 --> 00:01:11.120
Rio... Can I call you that?

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:12.590
Of course.

00:01:12.590 --> 00:01:14.500
Please, do everything the 
way you have been doing it.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:17.480
I will do that.

00:01:17.480 --> 00:01:19.510
Your speech hasn't changed back.

00:01:19.510 --> 00:01:21.320
Oh! Yes, uh, yeah.

00:01:21.660 --> 00:01:24.280
This is all so sudden.
 It must be troubling,

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:27.520
but Miss Ruri, I hope to 
continue our relationship.

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.250
Yeah, all right.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.110
Oh. That means...

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:34.270
Since we're cousins, calling 
me "Miss" Ruri is a little...

00:01:34.670 --> 00:01:37.740
I want you to refer to me 
in a more familiar way.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:38.710
Can't you?

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:42.080
Well, um... Yes, that's true.

00:01:42.080 --> 00:01:45.370
No, sorry. You're right, Ruri.

00:01:45.760 --> 00:01:47.290
Will this work all right?

00:01:48.390 --> 00:01:49.040
Yeah!

00:01:51.190 --> 00:01:54.330
And, this might be a little premature, but...

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:59.790
There is something I would 
like to tell both of you.

00:01:59.790 --> 00:02:01.890
You're being so formal. What is it?

00:02:02.480 --> 00:02:07.390
I'm thinking of leaving this 
village by this time next year.

00:02:07.390 --> 00:02:12.050
I see. You will be missed, 
but it can't be helped, can it?

00:02:12.610 --> 00:02:15.320
Will you return to the land 
where you grew up?

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.890
Yes. There's somewhere I'd like 
to stop by along the way, too.

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:22.780
You'll come back to this village 
again someday, won't you?

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:27.420
Well... If it's permitted, 
I'd like to come back one day.

00:02:27.420 --> 00:02:29.920
Of course it's allowed!

00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:31.400
What are you talking about?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:34.040
That's right. Come back any time.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:36.130
You're a member of this village, you know?

00:02:36.440 --> 00:02:38.210
Thank you very much.

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.630
I was wondering...

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:41.640
Since you said there was somewhere 
you wanted to stop by,

00:02:42.040 --> 00:02:45.600
does that mean there's someone 
waiting for you there?

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:47.800
We aren't related by blood,

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:50.700
but there's someone who thinks 
of me as an older brother...

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.210
Seirei Gensouki

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:11.210
Seirei Gensouki

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:26.870
<b>Each of Their Decisions</b>

00:04:22.030 --> 00:04:26.870
<b>Each of Their Decisions</b>

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.450
Hello!

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:28.990
Huh? Rio, what is it?

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.240
Oh, Ruri.

00:04:30.640 --> 00:04:34.320
I haven't said hello to 
everyone since coming back,

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:36.880
so I thought I'd go around 
and see everyone properly.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:38.660
Oh, I see.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.710
Huh? What is it?

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:41.870
That manner of speaking!

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:44.250
Sir Rio, your tone of voice...

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:47.040
Why are you speaking with 
Miss Ruri that way like it's normal?

00:04:47.040 --> 00:04:47.860
Huh?

00:04:47.860 --> 00:04:49.610
Oh, this is...

00:04:49.610 --> 00:04:51.460
What's the meaning of this, Ruri?

00:04:51.460 --> 00:04:53.560
Well, um...

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:56.600
I mean, we're living in the same house.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:05:01.950
I just asked him to stop using all 
that formal language, that's all.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:06.870
She asked—Miss Ruri 
asked me a long time ago,

00:05:06.870 --> 00:05:09.180
so I've tried to change 
the way I speak, but...

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:10.610
Does it sound strange?

00:05:10.610 --> 00:05:11.690
No!

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.120
It isn't strange.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:14.990
I want that, too!

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:14.990
Sir Rio!

00:05:14.990 --> 00:05:15.980
It's not fair!

00:05:42.990 --> 00:05:44.150
Rio!

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:48.610
I planted the seedlings in my area
 just the way you told me to!

00:05:48.980 --> 00:05:50.160
Thank you!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:53.730
Then, will you go and help the 
others who haven't finished yet?

00:05:54.610 --> 00:05:55.890
Will do!

00:05:56.370 --> 00:05:57.410
Rio!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:00.180
Ruri's so hardworking! 
She'll make a good bride!

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:00.880
What?

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:02.850
I think so, too!

00:06:02.850 --> 00:06:05.040
What are you talking about? Stop it!

00:06:05.040 --> 00:06:06.720
Don't tease me like that.

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.670
Miss Sayo?

00:06:11.710 --> 00:06:13.220
Shall I help you?

00:06:13.220 --> 00:06:16.340
Huh? Oh! Sir Rio, I-I'm so sorry.

00:06:16.340 --> 00:06:17.770
I wasn't paying attention.

00:06:17.770 --> 00:06:19.980
Please make sure you remember everything.

00:06:20.630 --> 00:06:25.010
I'd like you to supervise everyone 
in the village in what I've taught.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.390
After I've gone, too.

00:06:28.590 --> 00:06:29.320
What?

00:06:29.320 --> 00:06:32.280
Though it all depends on 
whether it turns out well.

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:33.990
Sir Rio...

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:36.310
Are you leaving the village?

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:37.350
Yes.

00:06:37.350 --> 00:06:39.870
I haven't told anyone else yet,

00:06:40.270 --> 00:06:43.410
but this fall, around the time 
the harvest festival ends,

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:44.890
that's when I'm thinking of going.

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:50.270
This fall... I see...

00:06:50.950 --> 00:06:52.260
B-But...

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:56.040
if you're staying close, you could come back 
to the village regularly, couldn't you?

00:06:56.040 --> 00:06:59.000
I'm planning to travel across the country,

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.650
so I don't know if I'll be 
able to come back regularly.

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.230
Oh, but...

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.610
It's still early,

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:09.460
but I wanted to tell you well 
ahead of time, Miss Sayo.

00:07:10.830 --> 00:07:11.920
Miss Sayo?

00:07:12.830 --> 00:07:14.120
Is something wrong?

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.640
Oh! No. It's nothing.

00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.780
I got something in my eye.

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:23.210
Oh, I see! It's because 
I have dirt on my hands!

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:27.610
I'll use spirit arts to make some water.
 Please, use it to wash.

00:07:29.620 --> 00:07:30.880
Sayo!

00:07:32.360 --> 00:07:33.760
What's wrong?

00:07:33.760 --> 00:07:37.640
I got some dirt in my eye. 
Sir Rio was helping me wash it away.

00:07:37.640 --> 00:07:39.220
Oh, are you all right?

00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:40.370
Yes.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:44.630
I'm behind on my section, 
so I'll go back to work.

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:48.160
Oh, I'll help you!

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:09.000
I'm back.

00:08:10.210 --> 00:08:12.760
H-Hey... Sayo?

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:17.790
What's wrong? Did something happen?

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:20.820
Sorry, Big Brother. I'm fine.

00:08:20.820 --> 00:08:23.330
It's nothing. I'll make dinner.

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.770
This is no time to be cooking, is it?

00:08:25.770 --> 00:08:28.480
Who was it? Who made you cry?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.240
Was it Rio?

00:08:30.240 --> 00:08:33.530
N-No, it's not like... 
Sir Rio didn't do anything wrong.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:35.100
That dirtbag!

00:08:35.790 --> 00:08:37.630
No! It's not like that!

00:08:38.420 --> 00:08:42.000
Sir Rio said he'll be leaving the village.

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:43.010
That's why...

00:08:43.750 --> 00:08:45.750
He's leaving the village?

00:08:45.990 --> 00:08:50.710
It's not like that. It has 
nothing to do with Sir Rio.

00:08:53.430 --> 00:08:54.170
Huh?

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:56.640
B-Big Brother!

00:08:56.640 --> 00:08:57.890
Wait!

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:02.810
Hey, Rio!

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:04.130
Rio, are you there?

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:08.270
What do you want with Rio?

00:09:08.270 --> 00:09:09.180
Uh...

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:10.770
Oh, Rio.

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:12.400
I'm begging you!

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.150
Please, stay in the village!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:15.890
What?

00:09:16.300 --> 00:09:19.160
I-I know that what I'm saying is selfish.

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:23.620
But, please, don't say anything 
and just stay in the village!

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.710
B-Big Brother!

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.480
What are you doing?

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:31.500
I'm so sorry for the trouble 
my brother has caused you!

00:09:31.720 --> 00:09:35.850
Come on, Big Brother! 
You're bothering them! Come on...

00:09:36.160 --> 00:09:38.010
Sayo... But you...

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.020
I'm really so very sorry.

00:09:46.020 --> 00:09:49.120
My brother and I will talk 
everything through properly.

00:09:49.120 --> 00:09:53.000
All right. I won't ask you 
what happened for now.

00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:54.740
Are you all right with that, Rio?

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.720
Yes, that is fine, but...

00:09:56.720 --> 00:09:59.000
Th-Thank you so much!

00:09:59.670 --> 00:10:01.620
Come on. We're going, Big Brother.

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:08.040
Man, that bathwater was great!

00:10:09.020 --> 00:10:10.280
Did something happen?

00:10:10.650 --> 00:10:12.330
It was nothing.

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:24.790
Title and rank hold no meaning here!

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:28.670
If you have confidence in your skills,
 come and challenge me!

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:31.540
Go for it, Big Boss Gouki!

00:11:31.540 --> 00:11:33.740
Dola, you're up!

00:11:33.740 --> 00:11:36.130
Don't ask the impossible! 
There's no way I can beat him!

00:11:36.130 --> 00:11:37.170
Go on!

00:11:38.290 --> 00:11:41.790
To leave Sir Rio to one side and 
simply amuse himself at this feast...

00:11:41.790 --> 00:11:43.430
He'll be getting a severe scolding later.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:46.790
Oh, no. I would rather he enjoy himself 
without regard to status here.

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:49.470
Really? We'll do that, then.

00:11:49.470 --> 00:11:52.490
All right! We're making kamutan this year!

00:11:53.810 --> 00:11:56.310
Anyone who wants some, line up!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:03.500
He did it!

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:06.780
I think we should go ahead and eat.
 What about you, Komomo?

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:10.040
Yes! I'm looking forward to 
the kamutan Sir Rio made!

00:12:10.550 --> 00:12:12.810
Ah, that was quite enjoyable!

00:12:12.810 --> 00:12:13.840
Mistress Kayoko.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:17.670
Thank you so much for your help today.

00:12:18.050 --> 00:12:23.580
It's nothing. Lady Yuba kindly invited 
us to this harvest festival.

00:12:23.580 --> 00:12:25.050
It was the least I could do in return.

00:12:25.520 --> 00:12:26.880
We're honored and grateful.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:28.550
E-Excuse me...

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:31.060
Sir Rio, may I have a moment?

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:33.140
Yes. What is it?

00:12:33.140 --> 00:12:35.250
Um, I wanted to discuss something...

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:38.110
Father, you were amazing!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:39.620
You think so?

00:12:39.620 --> 00:12:40.980
I'll make it again sometime!

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:46.490
That hairpin...

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:48.760
You're still using it.

00:12:49.350 --> 00:12:50.990
Oh... Yes.

00:12:51.900 --> 00:12:53.280
I-I...

00:12:53.700 --> 00:12:55.000
Um...

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.890
I know it may be burdensome 
to hear this, but...

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.510
I-I...

00:13:02.370 --> 00:13:04.510
I am in love with you, Sir Rio!

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:12.870
Miss Sayo, I'm sorry.

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:16.860
I can't return your feelings.

00:13:18.480 --> 00:13:23.030
I-Is that because... Is it because 
you're leaving the village, Sir Rio?

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:26.590
That isn't the whole reason, but... yes.

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:29.580
Then, please, take me with you!

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:32.260
Th-That's not possible!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.830
I've worked hard so that 
I wouldn't slow you down!

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:41.300
I've trained my body and practiced my
 spirit arts every day for the last six months!

00:13:41.710 --> 00:13:43.260
That's...

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:45.830
Please! I'll do anything!

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:48.550
I'll do everything I can 
not to hold you back!

00:13:49.420 --> 00:13:51.780
That isn't the issue at all.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.560
I'm very sorry.

00:13:54.390 --> 00:13:57.560
I cannot return your feelings.

00:13:58.790 --> 00:13:59.780
That's all right.

00:13:59.780 --> 00:14:03.630
Even if you never look at me... 
Even if you never do anything for me...

00:14:03.630 --> 00:14:04.480
It's all right.

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:05.980
Just let me...

00:14:07.430 --> 00:14:08.820
At the very least...

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:11.860
Let me stay by your side.

00:14:12.260 --> 00:14:13.840
I beg of you.

00:14:13.840 --> 00:14:14.990
Miss Sayo.

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:16.580
I'm sorry.

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:19.080
I truly am.

00:14:26.210 --> 00:14:27.510
Sir Rio...

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:29.160
Wait...

00:14:34.030 --> 00:14:36.390
<i>I'm sorry, Master Shin.</i>

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:41.390
<i>That creep. He noticed.</i>

00:14:41.390 --> 00:14:43.510
<i>He really is a despicable one.</i>

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:44.590
<i>Blast it.</i>

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:57.120
Thank you for everything
 you've done for me.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:58.930
Take care, both of you.

00:14:59.430 --> 00:15:03.500
You don't need to set out 
when it's still so dark.

00:15:03.500 --> 00:15:07.170
I finished my goodbyes with 
everyone in the village yesterday.

00:15:08.050 --> 00:15:09.970
And it's going to be a long journey.

00:15:10.300 --> 00:15:12.610
You can come back home anytime, all right?

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:13.780
Thank you.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.200
So, in the end, she didn't come.

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:21.270
I'll be off, then.

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.430
Yes. Be sure to take care of yourself.

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:28.190
I will. Ruri, Mistress Yuba, 
I hope you both stay well.

00:15:29.850 --> 00:15:31.150
Rio!

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:33.070
Take care!

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:35.390
Have a good trip!

00:15:42.460 --> 00:15:43.830
Miss Sayo?

00:15:46.350 --> 00:15:47.590
Young lady.

00:15:47.980 --> 00:15:51.080
Are you in love with Sir Rio?

00:15:51.690 --> 00:15:54.050
What? Y-Yes.

00:15:55.040 --> 00:15:58.100
Do you love him enough to cast aside 
this village where you were born and raised?

00:15:58.450 --> 00:16:01.120
W-Well, I...

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.370
Good.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.920
I thought perhaps, but...
I seem to have misread things.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.740
W-Wait, please!

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:08.860
I love him!

00:16:08.860 --> 00:16:11.030
I love Sir Rio!

00:16:11.500 --> 00:16:14.530
And there is no falsehood in your words?

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:15.780
There is not.

00:16:16.810 --> 00:16:17.880
Then...

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.170
S-Sir Rio, um...

00:16:25.520 --> 00:16:28.170
Please, take good care of yourself.

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.770
I will.

00:16:31.770 --> 00:16:33.490
I hope you'll take even better 
care of yourself, Miss Sayo.

00:16:33.490 --> 00:16:35.530
I will. And...

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.060
Sir Rio!

00:16:37.060 --> 00:16:38.100
What is it?

00:16:38.100 --> 00:16:42.060
I'm going to work really hard! 
I'll do my very best, so...

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.270
You have to do your best too, Sir Rio!

00:16:44.610 --> 00:16:46.420
I will. I'll work very hard.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:50.650
G-Good.

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:55.340
I am truly happy you came 
to see me off, Miss Sayo.

00:16:56.270 --> 00:16:57.880
Thank you very much.

00:16:57.880 --> 00:17:01.710
I'm glad I gathered my 
courage and came here, too.

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:03.450
Goodbye.

00:17:03.450 --> 00:17:05.250
Yes. Until we meet again.

00:17:05.250 --> 00:17:07.900
That's true. Until we meet again.

00:17:29.110 --> 00:17:32.110
<b>Year 999 of the Holy Era, Late Autumn</b>

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:35.470
Is that...

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:37.490
Orphia's Ariel?

00:17:37.880 --> 00:17:39.810
Onii-chan!

00:17:47.120 --> 00:17:49.040
Welcome home!

00:17:52.310 --> 00:17:53.670
I'm back.

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.180
I was able to have a lot of good experiences.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.180
Well, that's the most important thing.

00:18:03.480 --> 00:18:06.770
Onii-chan, you have a 
grandmother and a cousin.

00:18:06.770 --> 00:18:11.770
When I told them I have a little sister, 
they both said they wanted to meet you.

00:18:11.770 --> 00:18:14.190
I think I might want to meet them, too!

00:18:14.970 --> 00:18:16.690
Well then, Sir Rio...

00:18:16.690 --> 00:18:20.160
How long do you think you will be able 
to stay in the village this time?

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:22.880
Probably a few months at most.

00:18:22.880 --> 00:18:25.200
You're leaving again, Onii-chan?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:26.700
I'm sorry, Latifa.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:30.190
I'll make sure I come back 
more quickly this time.

00:18:30.790 --> 00:18:32.170
That's a promise, right?

00:18:32.400 --> 00:18:34.170
Yes. That's a promise.

00:18:34.550 --> 00:18:35.860
Sir Rio.

00:18:35.860 --> 00:18:39.180
Was there anything you found yourself 
running short of on your journey?

00:18:39.180 --> 00:18:41.130
Oh, thank you.

00:18:41.130 --> 00:18:43.700
I still have plenty in 
the way of supplies,

00:18:43.700 --> 00:18:47.640
but as I was traveling, 
a thought did occur to me.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.940
I was hoping that you might lend your wisdom.

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.290
Of course. Tell us.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:56.630
Actually, I was thinking about building

00:18:56.630 --> 00:18:59.530
a house I could take with 
me in the space-time cache.

00:18:59.840 --> 00:19:02.780
Oh, a house, huh? 
That's an interesting thought!

00:19:02.780 --> 00:19:05.720
Carrying a house... That would mean...

00:19:05.720 --> 00:19:10.440
Would he want a house that could be 
set in place without a foundation?

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:11.530
Yes.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:13.090
But that said...

00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:19.020
He'd probably have to use spirit arts 
to prepare the ground every time.

00:19:19.020 --> 00:19:21.840
Once he's like this, 
he won't return for some time.

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.340
Indeed.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:27.140
Sir Rio, leave the house to Dominic.

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:32.000
In the meantime, you should spend all the 
time you can with Latifa and the others.

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:33.920
Right, Latifa?

00:19:33.920 --> 00:19:34.770
Yeah!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:38.360
I want to be with Onii-chan the 
whole time he's in the village!

00:19:40.030 --> 00:19:41.760
I've returned!

00:19:41.760 --> 00:19:43.110
Welcome home!

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:46.950
Were you able to have a nice 
long talk with the Eldest?

00:19:47.300 --> 00:19:51.390
Yes. I was relieved to see that 
everyone seems as sprightly as ever.

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:55.860
They all must have been surprised to see 
how grown up you've gotten, Master Rio!

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.280
I suppose they were. It has 
been two years, after all.

00:20:00.860 --> 00:20:02.800
Master Rio, you've grown so much

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:06.770
that Miss Sara and Alma seem to 
have gotten quite shy around you.

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.300
I-I'm not shy.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.100
The only shy one here is Big Sister Sara.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:15.140
A-Alma! Stop saying such weird things!

00:20:16.570 --> 00:20:19.210
Why are you laughing, Master Rio?

00:20:19.210 --> 00:20:20.650
No, it's just...

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:23.260
I just feel like I've really come home.

00:20:23.760 --> 00:20:27.780
Both of you have become more like 
grown ladies. You're lovely.

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:30.470
Th-Thank you.

00:20:30.470 --> 00:20:33.250
I haven't changed much at all.

00:20:33.530 --> 00:20:35.720
That's not true.

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.680
You've grown a little taller, haven't you?

00:20:37.680 --> 00:20:40.750
Yes, well... just a little.

00:20:40.750 --> 00:20:46.000
It must be so nice, Miss Sara, Alma, 
to have Master Rio praise you like that.

00:20:46.610 --> 00:20:49.060
Miss Orphia, you've become 
more beautiful, too.

00:20:49.570 --> 00:20:52.230
That calm aura of yours has only grown.

00:20:53.860 --> 00:20:55.310
Thank you very much!

00:20:55.700 --> 00:20:57.180
Say, Onii-chan!

00:20:57.180 --> 00:20:58.950
Want to take a bath together?

00:20:58.950 --> 00:21:00.010
What?

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:03.960
O-Of course he doesn't! What are you saying?

00:21:03.960 --> 00:21:05.030
But why?

00:22:44.250 --> 00:22:45.580
<i>What's this?</i>

00:22:51.070 --> 00:22:52.770
<i>So, I'm dreaming.</i>

00:22:52.770 --> 00:22:57.020
<i>I'm still asleep. That's for certain.</i>

00:23:02.260 --> 00:23:03.440
<i>Why am I...</i>

00:23:03.950 --> 00:23:06.160
<i>sleeping with a naked girl?</i>

00:23:16.720 --> 00:23:19.120
Wh-What's the matter, Master Rio?

00:23:23.090 --> 00:23:24.530
What's going on?

00:23:24.530 --> 00:23:25.660
What is it?

00:23:25.660 --> 00:23:27.130
What happened?

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:30.380
W-Wait! It's not like that! 
It's a misunderstanding! This is—

00:23:30.700 --> 00:23:31.880
What?!

00:23:34.970 --> 00:23:40.000
Next Time

